      "writtenOn": "2022-12-13T16:06:14Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "https://android-review.git.corp.google.com/c/kernel/common/+/1121591\n\nI have no idea of the history but it already exported a lot of CMA functions but not only cma_get_size. It\u0027s weird to upstream only cma_get_size without them.",
      "parentUuid": "bb5f4aaf_2bada807",
      "revId": "3973d6bfdfc9cd01117be071c5b57a51578fc044",
      "serverId": "85c56323-6fa9-3386-8a01-6480fb634889"
    },
    {
      "unresolved": true,
      "key": {
        "uuid": "6f189341_85fe3a9c",
        "filename": "/PATCHSET_LEVEL",
        "patchSetId": 1
      },
      "lineNbr": 0,
      "author": {
        "id": 1125653
      },
      "writtenOn": "2022-12-13T16:56:45Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "It has been 3 years to get the needed code upstream for this, why do we need to keep adding the symbol if the out-of-tree code is not ever going to be submitted?",
      "parentUuid": "80be7227_42a4aaa4",
      "revId": "3973d6bfdfc9cd01117be071c5b57a51578fc044",
      "serverId": "85c56323-6fa9-3386-8a01-6480fb634889"
    },
    {
      "unresolved": true,
      "key": {
        "uuid": "3528a455_c950e2c3",
        "filename": "/PATCHSET_LEVEL",
        "patchSetId": 1
      },
      "lineNbr": 0,
      "author": {
        "id": 1157738
      },
      "writtenOn": "2022-12-13T19:23:21Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Discussed this with Minchan and he pointed to a couple of unsuccessful attempts to export cma-related functions before:\nhttps://lore.kernel.org/all/20191003085528.GB21629@arrakis.emea.arm.com/\nhttps://www.spinics.net/lists/linux-mm/msg237394.html\n\nThese functions are needed for dmabuf-heaps which use CMA as storage. Since upstream is not keen on supporting dmabuf-heap features used in Android (we tried upstreaming that before: https://lore.kernel.org/linux-mm/20210121175502.274391-1-minchan@kernel.org/), I don\u0027t think we will be able to upstream this anytime soon (would require a generic in-kernel user).\n\nDue to this situation, I would ask to include the cma-related exports necessary for dmabuf heaps into android-mainline as a clear indication that we need them but don\u0027t see a way yet to upstream, so will support them long term as out-of-tree patches. Greg, WDYT?",
      "parentUuid": "6f189341_85fe3a9c",
      "revId": "3973d6bfdfc9cd01117be071c5b57a51578fc044",
      "serverId": "85c56323-6fa9-3386-8a01-6480fb634889"
    },
    {
      "unresolved": true,
      "key": {
        "uuid": "f264de1c_d6a44a5f",
        "filename": "/PATCHSET_LEVEL",
        "patchSetId": 1
      },
      "lineNbr": 0,
      "author": {
        "id": 1125653
      },
      "writtenOn": "2022-12-14T09:22:53Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Ok, but then also add the user of this function to the tree so that it is obvious what is happening here, do not rely on out-of-tree code for us to realize this please.",
      "parentUuid": "3528a455_c950e2c3",
      "revId": "3973d6bfdfc9cd01117be071c5b57a51578fc044",
      "serverId": "85c56323-6fa9-3386-8a01-6480fb634889"
    },
    {
      "unresolved": true,
      "key": {
        "uuid": "a4bcc86b_21113ef5",
        "filename": "/PATCHSET_LEVEL",
        "patchSetId": 1
      },
      "lineNbr": 0,
      "author": {
        "id": 1275554
      },
      "writtenOn": "2022-12-14T17:55:06Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Thing is each vendor uses exported CMA functions as different implementation afaik(I guess most usecase would be dmabuf(old ION)) since some implementation relies on the vendor specific feature(sometimes, dependent with HW feature) so there is no standard implementation to be general if we want to land it into android-mainline.",
      "parentUuid": "f264de1c_d6a44a5f",
      "revId": "3973d6bfdfc9cd01117be071c5b57a51578fc044",
      "serverId": "85c56323-6fa9-3386-8a01-6480fb634889"
    },
    {
      "unresolved": true,
      "key": {
        "uuid": "cb847505_20f9f541",
        "filename": "/PATCHSET_LEVEL",
        "patchSetId": 1
      },
      "lineNbr": 0,
      "author": {
        "id": 1125653
      },
      "writtenOn": "2022-12-15T07:12:07Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "We can\u0027t take an export without a user or a symbol table addition, so this shouldn\u0027t be added until such change is needed.",
      "parentUuid": "a4bcc86b_21113ef5",
      "revId": "3973d6bfdfc9cd01117be071c5b57a51578fc044",
      "serverId": "85c56323-6fa9-3386-8a01-6480fb634889"
    },
    {
      "unresolved": true,
      "key": {
        "uuid": "fdb9c3f8_1310ef03",
        "filename": "/PATCHSET_LEVEL",
        "patchSetId": 1
      },
      "lineNbr": 0,
      "author": {
        "id": 1275554
      },
      "writtenOn": "2022-12-15T18:50:24Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "About the user, it\u0027s used by vendor overriding dmabuf module along with other exported CMA functions by AOSP tag(Upstream never exported any CMA functions but Android exported most of them to support vendor module but not only this cma_get_size so what\u0027s the your main concern?)\n\nPresubmit doesn\u0027t emit any complain about the symbol. What symbol table addition do you mean?",
      "parentUuid": "cb847505_20f9f541",
      "revId": "3973d6bfdfc9cd01117be071c5b57a51578fc044",
      "serverId": "85c56323-6fa9-3386-8a01-6480fb634889"
    },
    {
      "unresolved": true,
      "key": {
        "uuid": "7b3ec6c8_6033323f",
        "filename": "/PATCHSET_LEVEL",
        "patchSetId": 1
      },
      "lineNbr": 0,
